Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…The Concealed Prayer.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:08.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato, what’re you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:12.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m making decorations with this pretty paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:15.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If I remember correctly, that paper is the manager’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.09,0:00:15.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:19.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose-san got a bunch on\Nsale at the shopping district,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:21.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,so she asked me to make decorations for the kids at Yomogi Preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.05,0:00:25.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to make a whole bunch of these and then decorate the walls and windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:28.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think everyone will like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:31.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I think they’ll just find them annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.11,0:00:35.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:37.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s called origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.93,0:00:40.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re supposed to {\i1}fold{\i0} the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:46.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What should I do, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:49.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t… I can’t fix it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:53.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course you can’t…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.83,0:00:56.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…fix what you’ve cut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:45.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:47.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.07,0:02:50.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been getting enough sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:52.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You look exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:53.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:57.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You can’t tell women they look tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:02:58.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ll hurt their feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:02:59.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:05.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll put these in the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.53,0:03:07.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:18.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:21.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:23.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:25.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:30.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um… Chitose-san wanted me to give\Nthese to everyone in Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:34.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, origami, and so much of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:38.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There was even more, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:43.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t know origami was something you fold, so I did something else with it…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:45.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:52.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:57.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:03:58.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:00.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:01.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.89,0:04:02.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.93,0:04:04.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei is…!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.97,0:04:09.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:10.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s take you to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:12.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There’s no way you’re fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:18.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really, if I just rest for a while…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:20.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll get better…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:22.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I know a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:23.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll go bring him right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:32.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.78,0:04:34.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:53.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, please open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.53,0:04:57.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please open up! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:04:59.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:01.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:02.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, where’s Shuichiro-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please help! Sayaka-sensei is…!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:09.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:29.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong with Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:32.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t have to worry about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:40.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:44.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s suffering from complications due to sleep-deprivation along with a mild gastritis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:47.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:50.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll give her some medicine later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.65,0:05:54.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Once she gets some rest and calms down,\Ngive her something easily digestible to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.99,0:05:56.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.61,0:05:58.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the sudden trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:05:59.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:01.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a good thing I just happened to be on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:03.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:05.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Will Sayaka-sensei be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:11.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She won’t be just bedridden if this ever occurs again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.32,0:06:16.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn’t consider this just fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:19.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.85,0:06:20.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.87,0:06:24.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:26.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:34.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:36.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.45,0:06:40.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s living with Kohaku-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:41.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.65,0:06:43.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that woman from before…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:44.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.50,0:06:58.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:03.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um… Is Sayaka-sensei sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.44,0:07:07.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:09.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:10.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:13.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The doctor said she’ll be better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:21.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you all aren’t in good spirits,\Nyou’ll just make Sayaka-sensei worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:29.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s all cheerfully sing so that Sayaka-sensei will get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:42.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Under the blue, under the blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:47.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,under the big blue sky
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:51.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,let us feel, let us feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,O}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sawarou sawarou}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:47.35,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,That damn Kobato totally forgot about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.16,0:08:10.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:12.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:17.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Will Sayaka-sensei get better, if\Nyou just sit there doing nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:20.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But, just a little longer…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:22.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Get a hold of yourself already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:30.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Looking after the children will be a better way to put her mind at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:45.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:47.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How’s the patient?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:48.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s calmed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:52.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. That’s good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:54.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you do this…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And then that…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.78,0:08:58.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, an angelfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:04.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see, so that’s how you do origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:09.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, look, Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:12.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:15.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko-kun, what are you folding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:16.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Cranes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:18.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Cranes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:20.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Cranes are birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:23.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It {\i1}is{\i0} a bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:26.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re folding a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:27.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. A thousand cranes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.83,0:09:35.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. To help Sayaka-sensei get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:38.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you fold a thousand cranes, she’ll get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:39.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:43.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, teach me how to fold cranes too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:44.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.99,0:09:46.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll fold cranes too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:47.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:49.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,680)}Then, let’s all fold them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:52.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:55.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:00.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is hard…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:03.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.01,0:10:03.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:09.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:23.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Will Kobato-san be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:26.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren’t you worrying about the wrong person?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:30.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Oh, right… But…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:36.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why I can't help thinking about Kobato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:45.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Will Sayaka-sensei feel better tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.15,0:10:47.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll be all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.78,0:10:49.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We folded a thousand cranes, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.93,0:10:51.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.59,0:11:05.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try to get back from my\Npart-time job as soon as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:07.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,so take care of Sayaka-sensei in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.43,0:11:09.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.97,0:11:13.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Contact me immediately if anything happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,24 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:49.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Manager, I’ve got a request…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.73,0:11:51.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:56.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Could I have my work hours reduced for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:11:59.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you needed the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.96,0:12:01.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that’s true, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:04.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,...something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.27,0:12:07.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:12.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,When you’ve got enough time again, I’ll be working you like a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:13.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:15.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:28.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.15,0:12:30.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:34.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been here this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.47,0:12:35.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:38.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What about the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:42.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Their parents came and took them home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:44.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:46.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for worrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Get some more sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:57.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to work through it all…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:02.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,After you came, I’ve been\Nwondering in the back of my mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:06.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,if I can trust you and Fujimoto-kun to take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:13.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If something were to happen to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you saying that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.95,0:13:21.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s… That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.39,0:13:25.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If something were to happen to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:29.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone… would be so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:31.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:34.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn’t say something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:42.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:14:01.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s enough for today. Go on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.33,0:14:05.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you’re just going to sit around spacing out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:09.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,you’ll just give me more trouble if you end up losing sleep over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:10.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Spacing out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.93,0:14:12.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t space out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:14.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll take care of things here, so go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.93,0:14:16.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t do anything clumsy while you’re spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:20.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Like I said, I don’t{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:21.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.79,0:14:29.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She sure told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:32.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That was great on her part.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:33.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.93,0:14:35.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan was right to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:39.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The children folded all of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:41.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:47.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,These are the cranes she folded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:49.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They all have the same flaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:53.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She really is a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{Sign ???}Statute Books
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.05,0:15:21.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you that worried about Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.45,0:15:24.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.02,0:15:30.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, nevermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:32.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:40.17,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Could her memories be coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign}Hanamaru Dri{drills?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{red}Japanese
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{left}I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{right}How fun!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.73,0:15:44.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho-chan, what’s the answer to #7?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.21,0:15:47.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Chise-chan, you don’t know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.17,0:15:55.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:56.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.63,0:15:59.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, is Chitose-san here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:03.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama’s at the neighborhood association meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:04.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:05.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:08.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san, you don’t look well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:08.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:10.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,...it’s an illness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.61,0:16:14.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:23.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not me…!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:28.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei is ill!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:37.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to do something for\NSayaka-sensei, but I don’t know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.07,0:16:42.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I folded a thousand cranes with everyone, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.89,0:16:44.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thousand cranes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:45.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:48.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I couldn’t fold them well…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:53.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What if the wish doesn’t come\Ntrue because of my bad folding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.77,0:16:55.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll be all right, Kobato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.77,0:16:58.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Your wish will surely come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.08,0:17:02.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope so…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:05.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.36,0:17:08.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember what Mama would\Nalways make us when we were sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:11.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Porridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:12.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, porridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.71,0:17:13.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, porridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:20.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama told us that porridge is easy to\Ndigest, so it’s good to eat when you’re sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:22.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy to digest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:24.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I think about it,\NShuichiro-san said that too…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.89,0:17:28.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“Give her something easily digestible to eat,” he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:31.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then Kobato-san, how about\Nyou make some porridge for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Sayaka-sensei will definitely get better, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:34.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:37.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll make porridge for Sayaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:40.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But how do I make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:43.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, Chiho-chan! How about you draw her a picture of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:44.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice idea, Chise-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:50.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks something like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:53.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is porridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.25,0:17:54.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s white…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.87,0:17:57.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And it’s kind of thick and syrupy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:18:00.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right! Thick… and… syrupy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.97,0:18:05.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And when we eat it, Mama tells us to be careful not to burn our tongues.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:07.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hot… hot…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.83,0:18:11.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And when you make it, put lots of water in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:14.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Soaked… in… water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.49,0:18:17.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This looks amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:17.04,KO,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that really going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.26,0:18:57.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who’s there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:05.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.15,0:19:09.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I was trying to make porridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign yellow} How to make porridge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{red}Hot Hot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{in the steam marks} White
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.97,0:19:15.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though Chiho-chan and\NChise-chan taught me how to make it…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t make it well…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.02,0:19:21.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Porridge is supposed to be easy to digest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:24.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why I wanted to make some for Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:32.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You put in rice and plenty of water,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:36.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,put it on the stove and wait for it to boil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:39.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Afterwards, you just let it cook on low heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:43.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For crying out loud, how did you make that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.11,0:19:48.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you let her eat that, you’d\Njust make her even more sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.33,0:19:58.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, don’t cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.62,0:20:03.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If Sayaka-sensei dies…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:09.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’ll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.90,0:20:11.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,People don’t die that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:13.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They could die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:22.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,People can die from the littlest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:26.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Like who?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:33.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.57,0:20:37.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei won’t die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.45,0:20:49.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:57.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:20:59.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This’ll give me 100% energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.10,0:21:02.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:05.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I might eat too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.28,0:21:07.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.87,0:21:10.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m glad I could help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:12.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I was the one who made pretty much all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:16.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:17.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.53,0:21:19.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.79,0:21:20.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:30.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You didn’t even get more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:35.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The confetti won’t increase\Nif you just keep staring at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.39,0:21:36.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:39.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t seem depressed about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.42,0:21:43.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that you mention it…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.19,0:21:44.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:52.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Back then, after crying in front of Fujimoto-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:57.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,it felt like a lot of things that had been\Nbuilding up inside me were unwrapped…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.32,0:22:02.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And it felt really warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:08.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you getting healed when\Nyou’re supposed to be doing the healing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.63,0:22:12.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.62,0:22:16.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is…?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:22.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.76,0:22:24.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.99,0:22:25.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.97,0:22:27.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Sayaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.97,0:22:29.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.10,0:22:30.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.97,0:22:31.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.99,0:22:34.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, are you feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.05,0:22:35.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.61,0:22:38.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Did our thousand cranes work?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.86,0:22:40.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:43.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…The Mysterious Lifeform.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
